        "description": {
          "text": "Updated labeling to allow use in patients with eGFR of 45 mL/min/1.73 m2 or greater with no dose adjustment (moderate renal impairment/CKD 3A)",
          "citations": [
            {
              "quote": "These Prior Approval sNDAs provide for changes to the current Prescribing Information to reflect that no dose adjustment is needed for patients with an estimated glomerular filtration rate (eGFR) of 45 mL/min/1.73 m2 or greater as supported by Clinical Study Report D1690C00024, entitled, \"A Multicenter, Double-Blind, Placebo-Controlled, Parallel Group, Randomized, Phase III Study to Evaluate the Glycemic Efficacy and Renal Safety of Dapagliflozin in Patients with Type 2 Diabetes Mellitus and Moderate Renal Impairment (CKD 3A) Who Have Inadequate Glycemic Control.\"",
              "doc_id": "15c86f39-4845-5bc0-8aef-cdf1f40fe044",
              "line": 6
            }
